name: Installed offline advisory scans preserve child source, literal paths and limited coverage
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/cargo_child_source.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME prepare
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
paste-file: @ART/open-literal.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 "client\\scope/Cargo.lock":6 | literal-child-finding
require-live-snap: 25 name = "time" | affected-package-source
expect: RUSTSEC-2020-0071
expect: version = "0.1.40"
expect-not: Map ✓
ask: Does the installed scanner's advisory remain a source-bound signal over hypothetical metadata, with the literal child distinct and no verified runtime vulnerability or accepted Map?
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/run-nested.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 35 cargo-audit: 1 advisory findings | nested-child-scan
paste-file: @ART/run-literal.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 35 cargo-audit: 1 advisory findings | repeated-literal-scan
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/cargo_child_source.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME direct
type: preserve offline audit draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/cargo_child_source.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME sast-run
require-live-snap: 25 preserve offline audit draft | external-scans-keep-draft
ask: Do two explicit headless SAST scans preserve the composer and two findings without duplicate identities, model work, database updates or target builds?
keys: C-u
paste-file: @ART/run-root.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 35 cargo-audit: 0 advisory findings | parent-only-scan
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/cargo_child_source.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME root
paste-file: @ART/open-literal.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 "client\\scope/Cargo.lock":6 | literal-source-review
submit: decision deferred Hypothetical dependency requires owner review of actual deployment
require-live-snap: 25 recorded: deferred | literal-decision
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/cargo_child_source.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME reviewed
resize: 160x48
live-snap: literal-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: literal-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: literal-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: literal-60x20
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 q review list | literal-source-reader
resize: 40x12
live-snap: literal-40x12
expect: "client\\scope/Cargo.lock":6
keys: NPage
live-snap: literal-page-1
keys: NPage
live-snap: literal-page-2
keys: NPage
live-snap: literal-page-3
keys: NPage
live-snap: literal-page-4
keys: NPage
live-snap: literal-page-5
keys: NPage
live-snap: literal-page-6
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/cargo_child_source.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME source-read
ask: Across six sizes and paging, are the literal child, retained lockfile and deferral distinguishable from its nested neighbor without suggesting the later empty parent scan fixed either finding?
resize: 120x36
keys: q
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/open-nested.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 │client/scope/Cargo.lock:6 | nested-source-review
expect-not: recorded: deferred
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 scope paths Cargo.lock | report
expect: 1 inspected file
expect: Advisory policy was not recorded
keys: j j j
require-live-snap: 20 format json | json-report
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/cargo_child_source.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME exported
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/open-literal.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 "client\\scope/Cargo.lock":6 | recovered-literal
expect: recorded: deferred
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/cargo_child_source.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain six real module scans, five advisory observations, two source-qualified findings and one deferral without accepting a phase, widening coverage or using a provider?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
